{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcab Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 40 unique and carefully handcrafted levels<br>\ud83c\udfb6 A relaxing and playful soundtrack<br>\ud83c\udf20 A simple, light, and cozy visual atmosphere<br>\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f A charming little spider you\u2019ll instantly adore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and challenge your mind in this delightful minimalist puzzle adventure.<br>Your mission is simple: <strong>connect all the stars and create the perfect path across the night sky</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore magical constellations, uncover beautiful patterns, and help a tiny spider weave its web among the stars in a calm, enchanting journey filled with wonder. \u2728</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude90 How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on a star to unlock new connections and possible paths.<br>Available stars will glow in purple \u2014 <strong>choose carefully to build the perfect route!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/e6c33ee1e2bac21ed040dd98a93f03a3.poster.avif?t=1770488846\" width=700 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/e6c33ee1e2bac21ed040dd98a93f03a3.webm?t=1770488846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 How to Win</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect <strong>all the stars</strong> so the spider can travel through each constellation.<br>Every level offers a new challenge \u2014 simple at first glance, yet full of clever possibilities.